SUMMARY:Black History Month
DESCRIPTION:February is Black History Month. It grew out of Negro History W
 eek\, which Carter G. Woodson and the Association for the Study of Negro L
 ife and History announced in 1925 and first held in February 1926\, and be
 came a full month in 1976\, the nation's bicentennial.\n\nhttps://todaycel
 ebrates.com/holiday/black-history-month/
